        {
            "title": "中國連續第18個月維持貸款市場報價利率不變",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"中國連續第15個月維持貸款市場報價利率不變\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78d25f92835751b6df8464c51fd7fe9e4e465a1027c12eee8d5a8f475a8b3d21/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEB7O0H7_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">中國連續第15個月維持貸款市場報價利率不變</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 中國週五宣布維持基準貸款利率不變，連續第18個月按兵不動，符合市場預期。此舉反映出決策者在支撐經濟增長的需求與進一步貨幣寬鬆的限制之間，仍在審慎權衡。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">作為大多數新增及存量貸款定價基準的一年期貸款市場報價利率（LPR）維持在3.00%不變，而作為房貸利率參考基準的五年期LPR則維持在3.50%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次決定出爐前，10月份數據顯示中國經濟動能有所減弱，工業產出增速放緩，零售銷售按年增幅亦有所收窄。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-5349ea4b-bdf9-3122-8d2f-8b6bc44bd992-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">中國人民銀行近期將主要政策利率調整為隔夜拆借利率。分析人士指出，此舉有助於改善融資環境並提升貨幣政策傳導效果，而毋須立即下調基準貸款利率。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E9%80%A3%E7%BA%8C%E7%AC%AC18%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88%E7%B6%AD%E6%8C%81%E8%B2%B8%E6%AC%BE%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E5%A0%B1%E5%83%B9%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%8A-021912794.html",
